    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a pretty blunt take. Can you expand on why those specific physical and social markers correlate so strongly with leadership effectiveness in high-stakes environments? Are there specific communication patterns you'd recommend we look for to identify that \"commanding\" quality?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
